        <mxCell id="arch_25" value="&lt;b&gt;Sizing and free-tier limits: 40 workers, 4 cameras&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;No tunnel or Nginx needed:&lt;/b&gt; Render&#39;s proxy already does HTTPS and forwards to the app.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Render:&lt;/b&gt; 512 MB, 0.1 CPU, sleeps after 15 min idle. Open the site a few minutes before the demo. SMTP ports blocked, so email goes over HTTPS.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Supabase:&lt;/b&gt; 500 MB database, 1 GB files, pauses after a week idle. At about 100 KB each, 1 GB holds roughly 10,000 snapshots.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Laptop GPU:&lt;/b&gt; start with a small YOLO26 model at about 5 frames per second per camera, and run OCR only on vest crops.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;If Render sleeps,&lt;/b&gt; detection keeps writing to the database." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#854D0E;fontSize=11;fontColor=#292524;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1050" y="620" width="400" height="325" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
